{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "加", "id": "加"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "智", "variants": [], "id": "智"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "飢渴", "id": "飢渴"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9810014688665833, "source": "加", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.5199979695992702, "source": "加", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 3.079613757534693, "source": "加", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 3.7727609380946383, "source": "飢渴", "target": "害"}, {"weight": 2.268683541318364, "source": "飢渴", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.9810014688665833, "source": "欲", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.5199979695992702, "source": "天", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "行", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.826850789039325, "source": "行", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.575536360758419, "source": "存", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "存", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "存", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "食", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.6933193964148026, "source": "食", "target": "義"}, {"weight":